{"availability":"available","full":"robokrunch/awesome-jev","name":"awesome-jev","description":"A curated list of resources for Jev — TypeSafe AI's System One decision model. Maintained by RoboKrunch.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":null,"stars":3,"forks":3,"created":"2026-09-19T23:11:42Z","updated":"2026-10-16T01:25:23Z","license":"CC0-1.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://robokrunch.com","topics":["ai-agents","awesome-list","edge-ai","jev","robotics","typesafe"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/masterset-ai/PhysicalEye-Decide-35B-demo","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.161Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.161Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.161Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:21.294Z","stars":3,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:29:27.793Z","stars":2,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-08T23:42:55.158Z","stars":2,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:52.305Z","stars":3,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:14:26.505Z","stars":3,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.161Z","stars":3,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A curated list of resources for Jev — TypeSafe AI's \"System One\" model that returns typed, calibrated decisions instead of text.","Jev doesn't chat. You send it structured state; it returns a probability distribution over your predefined options in 70–500ms, at $0.042 per million input tokens with output free. It was built by Diogo Almeida (ex-OpenAI, co-inventor of RLHF/ChatGPT), emerged from stealth in September 2026 with $40M in funding, and went generally available on 2026-09-21: no waitlist, $5 starter credits (120M tokens), with Vercel, Cloudflare, LangChain and Langfuse already adding it to their stacks (per Indian Express).","This list is maintained by RoboKrunch — we benchmark Chinese edge-AI hardware and run our own real-measurement Jev experiments (300 real API calls, real latency, real bills). Entries with our own measured numbers are marked 📊."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"76d6efe5aa1b985941a3b2f8666efff994b24b47eae6a9da403981a303d2195a","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.338Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.338Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A curated list of resources for Jev — TypeSafe AI's \"System One\" model that returns typed, calibrated decisions instead of text.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"kouhxp/gutsy — Open local decision models with calibrated probabilities: gutsy-0.8b v0.3 is a Qwen3.5-0.8B fine-tune behind a Jev-style Decisions-format API (yes/no, choice, score), so existing System One clients need only a new base URL — no text generation, no network calls, no per-call cost. (2★, Apache-2.0, created 2026-10-01; real non-fork verified via GitHub API, raw…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"fitz-s/luna-decision-model — Local service that runs existing Jev / TypeSafe decision code (yes/no, choice, score; semantic ask/find; Read Hook; selector MCP) on OpenAI GPT-6 Luna through your own Codex ChatGPT login — no metered API key. 中/EN docs. (0★, Python, MIT, created 2026-10-13; real non-fork verified via GitHub API, raw README verified)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"fitz-s/luna-decision-model — Local service that runs existing Jev / TypeSafe decision code (yes/no, choice, score; semantic ask/find; Read Hook; selector MCP) on OpenAI GPT-6 Luna through your own Codex ChatGPT login — no metered API key. 中/EN docs. (0★, Python, MIT, created 2026-10-13; real non-fork verified via GitHub API, raw README verified)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"taifoon-io/jev — @taifoon/jev: a grader for agent jobs — \"did the AI agent do the work it was paid for?\" Code checks the facts, Jev answers four closed questions about the delivery, and code turns the answers into complete / reject / needs-review with a receipt anyone can recompute. (0★, TypeScript, created 2026-09-27; real non-fork verified via GitHub API, raw README verified)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Explicitly not an OpenAI/TypeSafe/OpenRouter product; generation still runs on your Codex login. (1★, no license declared, created 2026-09-29; real non-fork verified via GitHub API, raw README verified)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Install from source for now; needs a TypeSafe API key. (0★, Apache-2.0, created 2026-09-29; real non-fork verified via GitHub API, raw README verified)","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"76d6efe5aa1b985941a3b2f8666efff994b24b47eae6a9da403981a303d2195a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.342Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T01:25:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/robokrunch/awesome-jev/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:51.367Z","hash":"76d6efe5aa1b985941a3b2f8666efff994b24b47eae6a9da403981a303d2195a","originalBytes":929560,"storedBytes":929560,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["jev","verified","api","real","via","created","github","readme","raw","non-fork","mit","one","typesafe","model","decision","python","author","code","decisions","per","own","typed","license","agent","questions","declared","against","every","local","claude","models","live","choice","text","typescript","system","on